{"hw":"μής","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">μής</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">μής</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> v. μείς. <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">μῆστο:</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐβουλεύσατο</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span>; cf. <span class=\"gk\">μήδομαι</span>.</div></div>"}